  "description": "A self-contained Bencode (BEP 3) library for .NET 8 and .NET 10, shaped after System.Text.Json: the BencodeSerializer POCO mapper (converters, the full attribute family, naming policies, callbacks), the forward-only ref-struct Utf8BencodeReader/Utf8BencodeWriter token surface, a mutable BencodeNode DOM, and a read-only BencodeDocument DOM. Reads and writes canonical BEP 3 (ascending unique dictionary keys, single root) and can return a value's exact encoded slice for info-hash scenarios.",
